    "text_full": "Thursday, May 21, 2026\nTRENDING\nTejasswi Prakash and Karan Kundrra Get Engaged! A Complete Relationship Timeline of TejRan’s Love Story From ‘Bigg Boss 15’ to Dream ProposalDaily Horoscope for May 21, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Cancer, Virgo, Taurus and MoreSalman Khan News Today: Why the Bollywood Superstar Is Trending All Over Social Media!‘Michael’ Best Scenes: Jaafar Jackson Channels the ‘King of Pop’ Perfectly in Blockbuster Michael Jackson BiopicMouni Roy Brings Desi Royalty to Cannes 2026 in a Stunning Gujarati Patola Gown, See Pics‘Khatron Ke Khiladi 15’ Contestants Fees: Who Is Likely the Highest Paid Contestant on Rohit Shetty’s Show?Seema Singh’s Cannes 2026 Appearance With Son Shrey Singh Is All About Grace, Glamour and Indian CultureAfter ‘Mortal Kombat II’, Get ‘Mortal Kombat 3’ Update: From Storyline to Cast, All You Need to Know'Dragon' Star Jr NTR Birthday: 5 Iconic Performances That Proved He is Tollywood’s True ‘Young Tiger’‘Off Campus’ Season 2 Release Date Announced? Everything To Know About the Returning Briar University SeriesJr NTR’s ‘Dragon’ Cast, Release Date and Plot Details: An Assassin, a Cop and a Deadly Showdown Await'India's Got Latent 2' Guest Rumours: Alia Bhatt, Sharvari on Samay Raina's Show? Leaked Image Goes ViralDaily Horoscope for May 20, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Scorpio, Aquarius, Aries and MoreJr NTR's Movie ‘Dragon’ Release Date: Prashanth Neel’s High-Octane Action Spectacle Unveils Powerful First GlimpseJacqueline Fernandez Turns Heads at Cannes 2026 Chopard Miracles Gala in Elegant Vintage-Inspired Black Dress\nEntertainment\nTV\nOTT\nMusic\nGlobal\nSports\nBollywood\nSouth\nHome\nEntertainment\nOTT\n‘Dhurandhar 2’ OTT Release Date Announced: When And Where To Watch Ranveer Singh’s Spy Action Thriller Online In India\n‘Dhurandhar 2’ OTT Release Date Announced: When And Where To Watch Ranveer Singh’s Spy Action Thriller Online In India\nRanveer Singh’s ‘Dhurandhar The Revenge’ is finally heading to OTT after its successful theatrical run. Here’s when and where audiences in India can stream Aditya Dhar’s spy-action thriller online, along with details about its special digital premiere.\nRishika SinghMay 18, 2026, 09:45 IST\n\nRanveer Singh's Dhurandhar The Revenge has been one of the biggest theatrical outings of 2026 and now the wait for its digital debut in India is finally over. The spy-action blockbuster, directed by Aditya Dhar, is headed to JioHotstar very soon.\n\nWhat makes this OTT arrival particularly interesting is the way the platform has built the experience around it. Indian viewers are not just getting a film drop. They are getting a full premiere moment, one that fans of Dhurandhar 2 have been keenly waiting for.\n\n'Dhurandhar 2' OTT Release Date on OTT platform\n\nThe film will have its digital premiere on JioHotstar on 4 June 2026, with a 30-minute pre-show going live before the film. The pre-show will include behind-the-scenes footage, cast conversations and moments from the making of the film. From 5 June, the film will be open to all viewers on the platform.\n\n'Dhurandhar 2' RAW And Undekha Version On OTT\n\nJioHotstar will stream Dhurandhar The Revenge in its RAW and Undekha versions, which means audiences will see the film exactly as Aditya Dhar originally intended it. No cuts, no edits. The film also features R Madhavan, Arjun Rampal, Sanjay Dutt, Sara Arjun and Rakesh Bedi alongside Ranveer Singh.\n\n'Dhurandhar 2' Box Office Collection Before OTT Release\n\nEven after 57 days in theatres, the film is still pulling audiences. Its India net collection stands at Rs 1,144.56 crore, with a worldwide gross crossing Rs 1,796 crore. The film had already made its OTT debut for international audiences on 14 May on Netflix.\n\nDhurandhar The Revenge has clearly had a remarkable theatrical run and its JioHotstar arrival is only going to bring a fresh wave of viewers to the story.\n\nTRENDING\n\nTejasswi Prakash and Karan Kundrra Get Engaged! A Complete Relationship Timeline of TejRan’s Love Story From ‘Bigg Boss 15’ to Dream Proposal\n\nDaily Horoscope for May 21, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Cancer, Virgo, Taurus and More\n\nSalman Khan News Today: Why the Bollywood Superstar Is Trending All Over Social Media!\n\n‘Michael’ Best Scenes: Jaafar Jackson Channels the ‘King of Pop’ Perfectly in Blockbuster Michael Jackson Biopic\n\nMouni Roy Brings Desi Royalty to Cannes 2026 in a Stunning Gujarati Patola Gown, See Pics\n\n‘Khatron Ke Khiladi 15’ Contestants Fees: Who Is Likely the Highest Paid Contestant on Rohit Shetty’s Show?\n\nSeema Singh’s Cannes 2026 Appearance With Son Shrey Singh Is All About Grace, Glamour and Indian Culture\n\nAfter ‘Mortal Kombat II’, Get ‘Mortal Kombat 3’ Update: From Storyline to Cast, All You Need to Know\n\n'Dragon' Star Jr NTR Birthday: 5 Iconic Performances That Proved He is Tollywood’s True ‘Young Tiger’\n\n‘Off Campus’ Season 2 Release Date Announced? Everything To Know About the Returning Briar University Series\n\nJr NTR’s ‘Dragon’ Cast, Release Date and Plot Details: An Assassin, a Cop and a Deadly Showdown Await\n\n'India's Got Latent 2' Guest Rumours: Alia Bhatt, Sharvari on Samay Raina's Show? Leaked Image Goes Viral\n\nDaily Horoscope for May 20, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Scorpio, Aquarius, Aries and More\n\nJr NTR's Movie ‘Dragon’ Release Date: Prashanth Neel’s High-Octane Action Spectacle Unveils Powerful First Glimpse\n\nJacqueline Fernandez Turns Heads at Cannes 2026 Chopard Miracles Gala in Elegant Vintage-Inspired Black Dress\n\nRelated Articles\n‘Off Campus’ Season 2 Release Date Announced? Everything To Know About the Returning Briar University Series\n‘The Boys’ Season 5 Episode 8 India Release Date and Time: How To Watch Karl Urban and Antony Starr’s Epic Series Finale\n‘Brothers and Sisters’ Web Series Release Date: Bose Venkat’s New Tamil Family Dr